The OOC library modules oocIntStr needs, from voc (src/library/ooc), for code shared
between voc and polpo (http). Copyright Michael Griebling and others, LGPL (see the
module headers).

Changed for the polpo compilers: FOR loops are WHILE loops (the ARM compiler has no FOR),
oocCharClass.systemEol is exported with * instead of - (read-only exports are not known
to the ARM compiler). The interfaces are those of voc.
